    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. I noticed the score would be pretty high with this version, which is good, but if I'm being honest, it feels a bit clunky. It's like every sentence is just a different way to slot in a keyword, and it's getting a little repetitive. \n\nCan we try to make it flow even better? I really don't want the recruiter to think it's just a list of buzzwords. Try to weave them in more naturally so it sounds like a cohesive story of their career, rather than just a professional-sounding string of terms. I'll still be looking at that coverage score, but let's prioritize the \"human\" feel this time.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
